# FeedmeAI needs no secrets in the browser. Everything that needs a key
# (OpenAI, Spoonacular, SearchAPI, YouTube) lives in the Cloudflare Worker
# under worker/ -- see the comments at the end of worker/wrangler.toml.
#
# Point the app at a different worker (a local `wrangler dev`, say):
# VITE_FEEDME_API=http://localhost:8787
